&lt;/h2>&lt;p>设 $y(t)\in C[0,1]$, 定义 $C[0,1]$ 上的泛函
$$f(x)=\int_0^1 x(t)y(t)\text{d} t\quad (\forall x\in C[0,1]),$$
求 $\Vert f \Vert$.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业251020</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251020/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251020/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="149">&lt;span>1.4.9&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#149" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>在 $\mathbb{R}^2$ 中, 对 $\forall x = (x_1, x_2) \in \mathbb{R}^2$, 定义范数&lt;br>
$$&lt;br>
\Vert x \Vert = \max(|x_1|, |x_2|),&lt;br>
$$&lt;br>
并设 $e_1 = (1, 0)$, $x_0 = (0, 1)$. 求 $a \in \mathbb{R}$ 适合&lt;br>
$$&lt;br>
\Vert x_0 - a e_1 \Vert = \min_{\lambda \in \mathbb{R}} \Vert x_0 - \lambda e_1 \Vert,&lt;br>
$$&lt;br>
并问这样的 $a$ 是否唯一? 请对结果做出几何解释.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业251008</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251008/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/251008/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="141">&lt;span>1.4.1&lt;/span>
